WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.103 --> 00:00:03.383
The filter. The boiler. The bathroom.

2
00:00:03.423 --> 00:00:06.043
Your home has a thousand
things to tell you.

3
00:00:06.083 --> 00:00:07.643
Meet HouseCairn!

4
00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:10.970
No more sticky notes on the fridge.

5
00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:12.830
No more lost quotes.

6
00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:16.946
And no more killer question:
when did we last do that?

7
00:00:16.986 --> 00:00:18.806
Every morning, what matters.

8
00:00:18.846 --> 00:00:21.026
Overdue, today, coming up.

9
00:00:21.066 --> 00:00:22.646
One tap, and it's done.

10
00:00:22.686 --> 00:00:24.046
Not now? Postpone it.

11
00:00:24.086 --> 00:00:27.846
Tasks come back on their own,
every 3 months or every spring.

12
00:00:27.886 --> 00:00:29.886
Start from a template, even faster.

13
00:00:29.926 --> 00:00:33.526
Every room keeps its memory, its
photos, even the paint colour.

14
00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:37.386
Every appliance gets its own page,
its warranty, its service contract.

15
00:00:37.426 --> 00:00:39.746
Need your plumber? One
tap, you're calling.

16
00:00:39.786 --> 00:00:43.586
Your stock knows what's left, where
it's stored, and where to buy more.

17
00:00:43.626 --> 00:00:46.326
The calendar looks ahead,
and drops right into yours.

18
00:00:46.366 --> 00:00:49.786
The history keeps everything,
real cost included.

19
00:00:49.957 --> 00:00:51.937
Example: the espresso machine.

20
00:00:51.977 --> 00:00:55.317
Descaling comes back every 3 months,
with its filter.

21
00:00:55.357 --> 00:00:56.457
You tap Done.

22
00:00:56.497 --> 00:01:00.957
Stock drops from 2 to 1, and HouseCairn
gives you a heads-up: running low!

23
00:01:00.997 --> 00:01:05.677
€7.90 a filter, €31.60 a year,
already in the budget.

24
00:01:07.853 --> 00:01:09.433
Now, the bathroom.

25
00:01:09.473 --> 00:01:12.073
A walk-in shower, your
ideas saved as links.

26
00:01:12.113 --> 00:01:13.933
Two quotes, side by side.

27
00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:16.653
You accept €2,850.

28
00:01:16.693 --> 00:01:18.513
Planned, €4,200.

29
00:01:18.553 --> 00:01:21.153
Committed, €2,850.

30
00:01:21.193 --> 00:01:22.953
Paid, €480.

31
00:01:22.993 --> 00:01:26.473
And this year's envelope,
€6,000, always in sight.

32
00:01:29.658 --> 00:01:30.738
And there's more!

33
00:01:30.778 --> 00:01:33.218
A leak? Snap a photo, and it's a task.

34
00:01:33.258 --> 00:01:35.878
A QR label on the boiler,
and its page opens.

35
00:01:35.918 --> 00:01:38.178
Invite your household, run several homes.

36
00:01:38.218 --> 00:01:41.118
Reminders arrive by
email, Apprise or push.

37
00:01:41.158 --> 00:01:42.898
Home Assistant is plugged in.

38
00:01:42.938 --> 00:01:44.978
Export, archive, restore.

39
00:01:45.018 --> 00:01:46.738
In English and in French.

40
00:01:46.778 --> 00:01:49.338
And the mobile app even works offline.

41
00:01:54.573 --> 00:01:57.153
HouseCairn is free
software, it's self-hosted,

42
00:01:57.193 --> 00:01:59.773
and your home never forgets a thing again.

43
00:01:59.813 --> 00:02:02.393
Get it at housecairn.app!

